  REQ[Request] --> PEP[PEP]
  PEP --> AUDIT[Audit Admission]
  AUDIT --> GATE[Governed Gateway]
  GATE --> FS[Read-only Synthetic FS]
  GATE --> MOCK[Synthetic Tool]
  GATE -. DENY .-> NET[Network]
  GATE -. DENY .-> DB[Database]
  GATE -. DENY .-> SHELL[Shell/Subprocess]
  GATE -. DENY .-> WF[Workflow/Webhook]
  GATE -. DENY .-> CLOUD[Provider/Cloud]
  MODEL[Model Output] -. untrusted .-> PEP
